Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.94,0:02:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the season when girls look prettier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel like buying me a present?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.81,0:02:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a funny joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, very funny indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,At times like this, I wish you were my boyfriend. You'd buy me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're siblings, just siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this, and that, and this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.27,0:02:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:45.94,Title,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\c&HE8E7C5&\fad(1000,0)\pos(480,210)}Love Love Hiking.\N The Case of Yasujirou...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Love Love Hiking. The case of Yasujirou...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, let's have some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do-ra-go-n.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon? Ryu... Ryuuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Let's not have it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? It doesn't matter where we stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.73,0:03:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the master of this café.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come in. Don't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, my head aches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.15,0:03:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My, I'm really surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So you own a café?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to run a café.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, Miyuki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're interested, I'll give you this café anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The cute master is included.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:41.98,Thought,,0,0,0,,Don't agree so readily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki-chan, I'll treat you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have lemonade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have a pork cutlet sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,One lemonade on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,One pork cutlet sandwich with a receipt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back anytime, Miyuki-chan. No charge for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you can come here once in a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but not free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki-chan, if you marry me, I'll give you this whole café.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.19,0:04:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryuuichi is simple-minded. He'll take you seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryuuichi asked you to marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just say "Ah, that."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you never know about the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who do you think would be good for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That is... well... like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:54.56,Thought,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:55.81,Thought,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't approve of anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:05:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you until you get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what if I never get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I won't get married either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, I'll never get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.27,0:05:24.23,Thought,,0,0,0,,I don't know about my future...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:26.52,Thought,,0,0,0,,but for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:27.98,Thought,,0,0,0,,Miyuki is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, Miyuki-chan is cute.{Yes, he' saying something like "in other words" "that is to say"}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Twin-Blade Delivery Service. Let's deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I had a better photo of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time we're out on a date,\N I'll bring my camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.27,0:06:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, Miyuki-chan is really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two. One, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There. Yes, I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I just closed the door with my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's time for dinner. I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't accept gifts from strangers, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a good person. He's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.73,0:07:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You say everyone is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But when guys are nice to girls,\N they usually have ulterior motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ulterior motives...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see? I'm not jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your egg is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not a kid anymore, so you should be more cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I weren't your sibling...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, n-nothing. I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Wh-What delicious looking fried eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So Brother tastes food with his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, next Sunday,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go hiking with the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.19,0:07:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That depends on who's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already decided not to ask one person, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you referring to Ryuuichi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like him to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not even over my dead body!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! I'll get things organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll approve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,By any chance are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You may assume that I'll accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When youngsters go off by themselves, they always get into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:31.65,Thought,,0,0,0,,And who always causes the trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.15,0:08:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Muraki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Textbooks shouldn't be used as a hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Wakamatsu's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Wakamatsu, I'll get you a list of the girls who should participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, Miyuki-chan is one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You should exercise during lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unhealthy not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly, that car was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks. I have to go shopping at the supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.73,0:09:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:33.94,Thought,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your intent?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your motive for getting close to my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, it's nothing really like a motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.48,0:09:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to fool a girl of your daughter's age?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well, she's younger than my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.31,0:09:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My girlfriend's father happens to be a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A-A police officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:10:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a very good one. \NDo you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an unbelievable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A very good one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.85,0:10:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, phone call for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kashima-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. Miyuki-chan? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, about the hiking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Muraki tell you about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do, Wakamatsu-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not going,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too. I thought I'd go if you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you should definitely go...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.02,0:10:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,with Miyuki-chan, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Miyuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.81,0:10:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.85,0:10:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um, I guess that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not going,{10：31：33}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go.{10:33:12}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.19,0:11:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get the bath ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:24.65,Thought,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm going out with Miyuki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.65,0:11:26.40,Thought,,0,0,0,,I don't want Miyuki to go out with other guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:31.31,Thought,,0,0,0,,I seem very selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:34.27,Thought,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:36.73,Thought,,0,0,0,,Rather, those particular guys are terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.44,0:11:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really just that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she gets a boyfriend who's athletic and smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, do you want me to scrub your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Don't open the door without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can scrub my back by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:11:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I was looking sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put your clothes over there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are those photos?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the best five girls in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.85,0:12:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Miyuki-chan is miles above all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.19,0:12:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you were still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Didn't you say you needed to see me about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow! You're very slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When I flashed the photos,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you should have said, "I'll ask these girls to go" or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you even do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Amusing. This hike will be amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And they call {\i1}him{\i0\fscx130} {\r}a teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wakamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.02,0:13:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The girls in the photos are good to go, except Kashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Miyuki-chan said she'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.65,0:13:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.85,0:13:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that if I go, she'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we cancel this plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, thanks, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:42.90,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:43.77,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Miyuki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki-chan, about the hike...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.10,Overlap,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki isn't going on any hike!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki, I'll finish my duties soon, so wait for me in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go home first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Something to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.19,0:14:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wakamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How come Miyuki-chan isn't coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As her guardian, I'm totally against such inappropriate hiking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This time he's after Miyuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tolerate this anymore. I'll beat him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.02,0:14:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Wakamatsu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you. This is my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.19,0:14:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the first time you've met, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.56,0:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I heard that you're a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. Some say I'm a very good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Wakamatsu-kun, how about coming with me for a drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.81,0:15:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.15,0:15:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.35,0:15:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You go ahead and wait for us in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to have a bit of a man-to-man chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:28.02,Thought,,0,0,0,,Man-to-man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about the hike from my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, her father is against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Her father says...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,it's inappropriate for high school girls and boys to go on an unchaperoned hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:15:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:16:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,her father isn't exactly the most unreasonable person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we look for a good solution, just for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Miyuki-chan's brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel, kneel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wrong to fool around with a young girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{missing tl - TLC}See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my student handbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.73,0:16:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're unique, Wakamatsu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give me your answer as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Wakamatsu-kun. You came at a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.10,0:17:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Do you know that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He asked me if I'd be his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These days, guys keep trying to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's up with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:27.85,Thought,,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:29.44,Thought,,0,0,0,,They're obviously criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki-chan, whatever happens,\N let's go on a hike together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Did my father say something in the car that's bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.35,0:17:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He was concerned about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a very good father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind. Please carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind letting my daughter go,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll go with you as a chaperone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And your sister will come as well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.77,0:18:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought insect repellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{there's mickey I wonder if disney finds this out whether this anime will be banned :D}Huh? Are the mosquitoes out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for your hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an easy target for bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I went a long way to buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So your errand was...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.02,0:18:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:19:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I was going on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.65,0:19:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really appreciate a sister who's so devoted to her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The phone's ringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Wakamatsu residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, it was nice to see you a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kashima Miyuki's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on what my daughter says,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.94,0:19:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you seem to have accepted my offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.73,0:19:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,May I speak to your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you pass the phone to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Miyuki is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes? Did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.15,0:19:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For me? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki-chan's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice. Twin-Blade Yasujirou!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:20:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. He's Miyuki-chan's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Miyuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.85,0:20:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no. I'm going to the bookstore over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.77,0:20:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Miyuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.81,0:20:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.85,0:20:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Miyuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.06,0:20:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wakamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I ran into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakata-sensei, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,From that bookstore to this café.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go, Wakamatsu, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.19,0:20:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, waiter,{Really sound like Ueta ウエタ but I think it's waiter ウェイタ btw this VA does voice over for Schwarzenegger like terminator and he's crap I don't like his voice} I just want tap water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.40,0:20:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to go to a bookstore?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You know. I want a map for Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for a map, don't worry. I already bought one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you going too, Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. As your teacher, I have responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryuuichi, you're also planning to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.73,0:21:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,on the hike my brother planned, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hike?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.23,0:21:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm his buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.98,0:21:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, it's Sunday, and we all meet at...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Station Square, 9 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunday, Station Square, 9 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You guys didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm just adding a reminder because,\N you know, I have quite a busy schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:28.77,Thought,,0,0,0,,Why didn't they tell me where we're meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening. This is the evening weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.81,0:21:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, the Kanto region can be confident of fine weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be able to enjoy leisure or outdoor activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.23,0:21:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we take on the hike for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I think rice balls would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.15,0:21:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked Kashima-san to make yours, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I have to make Yasujirou's lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Father, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.02,0:22:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And I suppose Kashima-san's will taste better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:14.60,Thought,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is the hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:16.27,Thought,,0,0,0,,I'm half-excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:17.85,Thought,,0,0,0,,half-worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:20.15,Thought,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.06,0:22:27.02,Thought,,0,0,0,,the weather means that's no longer a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.27,0:22:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's have lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I made this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.44,0:22:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.56,0:22:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.35,0:22:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.23,0:23:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tora-chan, everyone's late, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.48,0:23:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:15.60,Eng op,,0,0,0,,{\be3\c&HE8E7C5&\pos(444,714)}I want to dance barefoot under today's blue sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:23.56,Eng op,,0,0,0,,{\be2\q2\fscx95\c&HE8E7C5&\3c&H57303C&\pos(471,712.5)}White clouds drift by like accessories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:32.90,Eng op,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&HE8E7C5&\3c&H4B5A5E&\pos(478.286,714.857)}A girl's feelings are mysterious, changing like the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.35,0:00:39.85,Eng op,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&HE8E7C5&\3c&H867374&\pos(433.5,709.5)}They were high{ atmospheric pressure} with happiness a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:44.85,Eng op,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&HE8E7C5&\3c&H3F111D&\pos(412.5,711)}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:49.10,Eng op,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&HE8E7C5&\3c&H552029&\pos(448.5,709.5)}In the depths of your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:57.35,Eng op,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&HE8E7C5&\3c&H541D43&\pos(475.5,708)}tears are hiding, like a 10% chance of rain.
