Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:38.15,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}Hidden inside an old album
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:42.85,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}are a lot of memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.44,0:23:48.44,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}Underneath your innocent smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:56.02,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}are memories of days long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.23,0:24:02.27,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}When time is endlessly connected,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.81,0:24:10.81,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}you can never know when it will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.02,0:24:18.40,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)\q2\fscx85}The universe you can reach has no limits,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.10,0:24:24.52,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}and it surrounds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:28.60,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}Climbing the stairway to adulthood,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.85,0:24:32.10,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}you are still a Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.23,0:24:35.52,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}You have no doubts that someone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.77,0:24:39.23,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}will bring you happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:45.85,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}Someday you will realize
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.02,0:24:53.85,Eng ed,,0,0,0,,{\be2\3c&H000000&\fad(300,300)}that you were just a little girl.
